    "description": "A superficial collection of materials, archaeological excavation and a map of\nthe stone structure of the historic camp named \"Cuatro Pircas\" (\"Four\nStructures\")  was performed. The glass, metallic, ceramic, leather and seal\nskin remains, showed that these settlements corresponded to a seal hunter camp,\nprobably from North America, dating back to the beginning of 1820.",
